          "beforeText": "  /** Custom groups expose A/B-to-physical-slot mapping separately from allocation order. */\n  voiceGroups:{id:string;midi:number;slots:number[];operatorSlots?:[number,number];held:boolean;order:number;mode:ScspCodeConfig['mode'];owner:{kind:'keyboard'|'code';session?:number;channel?:number}}[];\n"
